    {
      "id": "2121488035103769043",
      "text": "This was Josi's third career game-deciding shootout goal, his first since 3/7/21 in Dallas.",
      "url": "https://x.com/KieserNick/status/2121488035103769043",
      "published": "2026-11-14T06:18:57+00:00",
      "likes": 26,
      "author": "Nick Kieser🏒",
      "handle": "KieserNick",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1795134512818450432/-ud7TrHk_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Seven wins in a row for the Nashville Predators. Captain Roman Josi puts a bow on this one. He's now 8-for-25 all-time in the shootout. https://t.co/aeFCk3trRp",
      "quoted_author": "Nick Kieser🏒",
      "quoted_handle": "KieserNick"
    },
    {
      "id": "2121485567687073939",
      "text": "Juuse Saros was Nashville's saving grace tonight in Vegas. He made a season-high 40 saves on 42 shots faced. Goaltending has been superb during this win streak. #Preds",
      "url": "https://x.com/KieserNick/status/2121485567687073939",
      "published": "2026-11-14T06:09:09+00:00",
      "likes": 60,
      "author": "Nick Kieser🏒",
      "handle": "KieserNick",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1795134512818450432/-ud7TrHk_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2121485146662867169",
      "text": "Don't tell new Pred Jack Drury that Roman Josi isn't a shootout taker. His reaction to this stat on @1025TheGame: \"Wow, I didn't know that. I had full confidence he was gonna score and was ready to jump over the bench and celebrate.\"",
      "url": "https://x.com/MaxHerzTalks/status/2121485146662867169",
      "published": "2026-11-14T06:07:28+00:00",
      "likes": 34,
      "author": "Max Herz",
      "handle": "MaxHerzTalks",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2075184586774953984/Gd4TODV7_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "That was Roman Josi's first shootout goal in five seasons (10/30/2021 vs. NYI). He had missed his previous six shootout attempts over the last four seasons @1025TheGame",
      "quoted_author": "Max Herz",
      "quoted_handle": "MaxHerzTalks"
    },
    {
      "id": "2121484996657725724",
